      "observation": "{\"query\":\"PIF Tower 385米 利雅得 阿卜杜拉国王金融区 最高建筑 高度\",\"results\":[{\"snippet\":\"#### 沙特利雅得 KAFD 区域 PIF 大厦遇袭事件\\n\\n和平日报，2026年11月19日，（星期四），沙特阿拉伯首都利雅得阿卜杜拉国王金融区（KAFD）发生袭击事件，导致公共投资基金大厦（PIF Tower，高约385米）及周边两栋建筑受损，相关消息于11月20日（星期五）广泛报道。\\n...\\n- 主要受损建筑： PIF 大厦（PIF Tower），系 KAFD 金融区及利雅得市的最高摩天大楼（高约385米），同时也是沙特公共投资基金总部所在地。\\n...\\n部分报道中所称的“最高建筑”特指利雅得市及 KAFD 区域内的最高塔楼。\",\"title\":\"和平日报 | 沙特利雅得 KAFD 区域 PIF 大厦遇袭事件\",\"url\":\"https://www.hepingribao.id/home/2026/11/20/%e6%b2%99%e7%89%b9%e5%88%a9%e9%9b%85%e5%be%97-kafd-%e5%8c%ba%e5%9f%9f-pif-%e5%a4%a7%e5%8e%a6%e9%81%87%e8%a2%ad%e4%ba%8b%e4%bb%b6/\"},{\"snippet\":\"(서울=연합뉴스) 예멘 친이란 반군 후티의 미사일 공격으로 사우디아라비아 국부펀드(PIF) 사무실이 입주한 사우디 수도 리야드의 초고층 빌딩이 파손됐습니다.\\n...\\nPIF 타워는 높이 385m, 80층 규모로 리야드에서 가장 높고 사우디 전체에서는 두 번째로 높은 초고층 빌딩입니다.\",\"title\":\"[영상] 어둠 뚫고 날아든 후티 미사일…사우디 80층 타격 순간 포착 | 연합뉴스\",\"url\":\"https://www.yna.co.kr/view/MYH20261120016800704?section=video/all&site=editors_picks_video_view\"},{\"snippet\":\"- 参观 PIF 大厦，这是利雅得最高的摩天大楼，高 385 米，共有 80 层\\n...\\n• PIF 大厦是利雅得最高的摩天大楼，高 385 米，共有 80 层。\",\"title\":\"KAFD 建筑奇观，建筑导览之旅。 | GetYourGuide\",\"url\":\"https://www.getyourguide.com/zh-cn/riyadh-province-l183666/kafd-architectural-wonders-a-guided-architectural-tour-t745485/?ranking_uuid=4c6532a6-d79c-4787-ba68-e0e34f4886d6&referral_redirect=1&visitor-id=PT7F4HPV82C2ZCLRFWI65L7VKBFVN6YV&locale_autoredirect_optout=true\"},{\"snippet\":\"Although authorities did not identify the building, photographs released by the civil defence agency appeared to show shattered glass and exterior damage to the tower housing the Public Investment Fund (PIF), the sovereign wealth fund at the heart of Vision 2030.\\n...\\nStanding 385 metres high, the PIF tower dominates Riyadh’s King Abdullah Financial District, which acts as a showcase for Saudi Arabia’s economic ambitions.\\n...\\nChaired by the Saudi crown prince, the PIF is one of the world’s larges\",\"title\":\"Houthi attack damages Riyadh's tallest building\",\"url\":\"http